henivr/status/1686012456819191808?s=20\n\nデフォルトヘアースタイル　服や小物関連\n旧　参考資料１～４\nhttps://twitter.com/pohenivr/status/1342870456362156032\n\n犬小屋やイメージ写真\n\nhttps://twitter.com/pohenivr/status/1342850818630770689?s=20&t=DkVIopClplE9uln2IcQVYw", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Date_morino/works/42", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/26b44fb1/uploads/origins/3914013e-8a49-4e88-a2df-2ccee8b14ad5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d61b5d7d1d180411d408ec1c90cf422c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/26b44fb1/uploads/origins/3914013e-8a49-4e88-a2df-2ccee8b14ad5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d61b5d7d1d180411d408ec1c90cf422c, https://si.imgix.net/26b44fb1/uploads/origins/3914013e-8a49-4e88-a2df-2ccee8b14ad5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ba2163e4c9cdc2154fe52835a36a14f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/26b44fb1/uploads/origins/3914013e-8a49-4e88-a2df-2ccee8b14ad5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f326f8bc1ad5639aef0499f0756b07d9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ビリヤードをするオッドアイで猫又のねこま\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/Fuz-WpyaEAIFBy4?format=jpg&name=medium", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Date_morino/works/41", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/51c080a2/uploads/origins/49af01cb-d473-4f33-855a-dccbf106f653?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ced8ec1efe243b0e0566fec808cfbd4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/51c080a2/uploads/origins/49af01cb-d473-4f33-855a-dccbf106f653?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ced8ec1efe243b0e0566fec808cfbd4, https://si.imgix.net/51c080a2/uploads/origins/49af01cb-d473-4f33-855a-dccbf106f653?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80b37a64c835abc1c5fb1ab5b1ad576b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/51c080a2/uploads/origins/49